:''Not to be confused with [[Aku Doge]].''
'''Demon Doge''' (鬼化わんこ, ''Onika Wanko'', '''Demonized Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Demon Doge
|image = E 764.png
|first appearance = [[7 Days on Mt. Fujikasane]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
A [[Doge]] with the horn of an ''oni'', 5 times the health, twice the speed, and one less knockback than normal Doge.

==Strategy==
Despite its stat buffs, treat this enemy as if it's any early-game Doge variant; that is to say, just kill it with decent attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]].

